       the resulting program can be made a filter for a handle with  [1mpcap_set‐[0m
       [1mfilter[22m().   The  result  of  [1mpcap_compile[22m() can be freed with a call to
       [1mpcap_freecode[22m().  [1mpcap_compile[22m() may require a network mask for certain
       expressions in the filter string; [1mpcap_lookupnet[22m() can be used to  find
       the network address and network mask for a given capture device.

